<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens &amp; Minor raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens &amp; Minor raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it upgraded Owens &amp; Minor Inc to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- said operations at the distribution company have stabilized and operating results continue sequential quarterly improvement in 1997.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said maintains its 1997 earnings estimate of $0.61 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 estimate of $0.82 a share and a 1999 estimate of $0.95 a share.</p>
<p>-- Owens &amp; Minor gained 3/8 to 11-1/2.</p>
</text>
